  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggxCQVx8uebBOuCOyQ1nS9PhZsuTkjsOpckH_4uoMnGS-auT7DwUqF7__DNhyphenhyphenP5F4L_mPCENRse2x0cyipeG2VyeKRLVjzV7dNF6b9nJ-CjrjoZKSpCldOjyy1gXox3jHCZovluuBfadlg/s1742/1599044272125.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"940\" data-original-width=\"1742\" height=\"346\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggxCQVx8uebBOuCOyQ1nS9PhZsuTkjsOpckH_4uoMnGS-auT7DwUqF7__DNhyphenhyphenP5F4L_mPCENRse2x0cyipeG2VyeKRLVjzV7dNF6b9nJ-CjrjoZKSpCldOjyy1gXox3jHCZovluuBfadlg/w640-h346/1599044272125.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><b><br /></b><p></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p>花蓮赤科山金針花海</p><br /><b>作品簡介</b><br /><br /><div><div>感受造物主ê奇妙創造，一年一擺ê金針花大開，ài上花蓮赤柯山，駛車30分鐘tsiah看ē著ê好光景。</div></div><div><br /></div><b>創作方式</b><br /><br /><div>手機仔hip--ê</div><br /><b>年份</b><br /><div><br /></div><div>2019年</div><br /><b>作者</b><br /><br /><div><div>封面圖ê作者名： Tân Hong Jōe 。</div><div><br /></div><div>作者簡介：80年代出世，真愛用相片記錄生活感動。</div></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEibQimhJqUFAb6kNNgyT6U_ZQ4GOZccMhmZBoJVwJgpXaWowTFvBWiQpjqwkDp1_3Go93-rvgr4bEWpvlZWrzOP9FovVUmhtuxFQ8j2quam3SuX2N4E-FRLZfsR4ahf_TNsm4KIKiYa3DAF/w281-h400/318%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; te